/* mailfiles_mag MODULE (primary) */
/* charset=ISO8859-1 */
/* lang=C20 */

/* mail-files handling object */
/* version %I% last-modified %G% */


/* revision history:

	= 2009-01-10, David A­D­ Morano
        This is being written from scratch to finally get an abstracted
        "mailfiles" that is fast enough for interactive use.

*/

